    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emily's Bizarre Dreams</strong> is a challenging precision platformer where you'll help Emily face her nightmares and fulfill her heartfelt wish: to speak one last time with her beloved late cat, Mr. Tom, by making a wish upon a shooting star.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304220/extras/a93391980b22922bb022a1bf5174c67c.avif?t=1748254685\" width=616 height=124 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to navigate a series of increasingly difficult levels filled with deadly traps and intricate obstacles. With tight controls and a focus on precision, every move counts as you explore Emily\u2019s surreal and dreamlike world. Featuring stunning environments, atmospheric music, and a touching story, this game offers a blend of emotional depth and technical challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What\u2019s Included</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Game Experience:</strong> Play through all levels and challenges in Emily's journey to grant her final wish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> Unlock different endings depending on the items you collect during your adventure. Every choice impacts the outcome of Emily's dream.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability:</strong> Revisit levels to explore hidden paths, uncover secrets, and improve your performance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304220/extras/86b8af940b20318a58bcae13fd760f7c.avif?t=1748254685\" width=616 height=124 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Precision Platforming:</strong> Tight, responsive controls ensure that every jump and movement is entirely in your hands. Perfect your skills to conquer complex levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Secrets &amp; Collectibles:</strong> Discover hidden items that not only expand the story but also influence the game\u2019s multiple endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Dreamworld Themes:</strong> Each level is set in a beautifully designed, surreal environment, reflecting the whimsical and strange nature of Emily's dreams.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional Storyline:</strong> Dive into a heartfelt narrative about loss, hope, and the pursuit of closure as Emily strives to fulfill her wish.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Estimated Playtime</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Story:</strong> Around 1-2 hours for experienced players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Completionists:</strong> Up to 20 hours for those exploring every secret and unlocking all endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emily's Bizarre Dreams</strong> offers a singular yet captivating mode of gameplay with rich narrative elements and a variety of endings to uncover. Are you ready to help Emily fulfill her dream and find closure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emily's Bizarre Dreams</strong> is a challenging precision platformer where you'll help Emily face her nightmares and fulfill her heartfelt wish: to speak one last time with her beloved late cat, Mr. Tom, by making a wish upon a shooting star.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304220/extras/a93391980b22922bb022a1bf5174c67c.avif?t=1748254685\" width=616 height=124 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to navigate a series of increasingly difficult levels filled with deadly traps and intricate obstacles. With tight controls and a focus on precision, every move counts as you explore Emily\u2019s surreal and dreamlike world. Featuring stunning environments, atmospheric music, and a touching story, this game offers a blend of emotional depth and technical challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What\u2019s Included</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Game Experience:</strong> Play through all levels and challenges in Emily's journey to grant her final wish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> Unlock different endings depending on the items you collect during your adventure. Every choice impacts the outcome of Emily's dream.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability:</strong> Revisit levels to explore hidden paths, uncover secrets, and improve your performance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304220/extras/86b8af940b20318a58bcae13fd760f7c.avif?t=1748254685\" width=616 height=124 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Precision Platforming:</strong> Tight, responsive controls ensure that every jump and movement is entirely in your hands. Perfect your skills to conquer complex levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Secrets &amp; Collectibles:</strong> Discover hidden items that not only expand the story but also influence the game\u2019s multiple endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Dreamworld Themes:</strong> Each level is set in a beautifully designed, surreal environment, reflecting the whimsical and strange nature of Emily's dreams.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional Storyline:</strong> Dive into a heartfelt narrative about loss, hope, and the pursuit of closure as Emily strives to fulfill her wish.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Estimated Playtime</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Story:</strong> Around 1-2 hours for experienced players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Completionists:</strong> Up to 20 hours for those exploring every secret and unlocking all endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emily's Bizarre Dreams</strong> offers a singular yet captivating mode of gameplay with rich narrative elements and a variety of endings to uncover. Are you ready to help Emily fulfill her dream and find closure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
